  "summary": "盘十二天同酉宫虽见羊铃但亦坐会辅弼魁钺，作者认为较盘十一轻。父亲庚申资料令天同忌及酉擎羊加重，乙丑大限太阴忌引动而记痛风。所述差异依原有组合，不将三方会照误作同宫，也不由混排补酉宫宫职；非医学诊断。",
  "summary_en": "Chart Twelve places Tian Tong at You, meeting Qing Yang and Ling Xing but also Zuo Fu, You Bi, Tian Kui and Tian Yue. The author judges its affliction milder than Chart Eleven. The father’s Geng Shen data introduce Tian Tong Hua Ji and Qing Yang at You; Tai Yin Hua Ji in the Yi Chou major cycle activates the pattern associated with reported gout. Meeting stars are not asserted to share a palace, nor is a functional palace inferred from the mixed chart. This is not a medical diagnosis.",
